InkReel
=======
The hand / pen images in assets/hands/ (and the pen-tip coordinates in hands.json) come from
"Inkplainer" (https://github.com/NadirWeb-App/Inkplainer-OS), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(see assets/hands/LICENSE-Inkplainer-Apache-2.0.txt). They were downscaled and re-encoded.
All Python code in this project is new and was written from scratch; only the *idea* of the
animation styles (outline / scanner / chunk-jump) was inspired by Inkplainer.
